ank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T09:19:03-07:00","id":447768,"title":"","content":"I do not like DBZ, and am horribly unfair to the show from a lifetime of prejudice towards it*.<br /> <br /> Soooooooo.....yes?<br /> <br /> *I at least am sound enough of mind to realize I'm wrong and even get an inkling of why it was good show to be part of the anime boom's start, but this is after years of blindly hating the show**.<br /> **Although I freely admit it has some damn funny episodes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T09:33:26-07:00","id":447810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/445906-reflexive-gift-activation-or-going-super-sayen?p=447768#post447768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do not like DBZ, and am horribly unfair to the show from a lifetime of prejudice towards it*.<br /> <br /> Soooooooo.....yes?<br /> <br /> *I at least am sound enough of mind to realize I'm wrong and even get an inkling of why it was good show to be part of the anime boom's start, but this is after years of blindly hating the show**.<br /> **Although I freely admit it has some damn funny episodes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm still constantly amazed that DBZ Abridged is able to cut out so much and yet the story is still pretty consistent. Even the characters are parodied for jokes and... Yeah it all fits even still. I recommend that, if nothing else from DBZ","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T09:39:42-07:00","id":447820,"title":"","content":"Well, there's a very strong difference between <i>Dragonball</i> and <i>Dragonball Z</i>. They are very, <i>very</i> different shows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T09:43:04-07:00","id":447841,"title":"","content":"BACK ON TOPIC:<br /> <br /> I have to agree with what Az has said, with how as we get used to how reflexive everything is, the more and more our jaws'll drop. Essence being the only limit, a Werewolf can hulk out in terrifying ways without even going to Gauru-heaven forbid when they do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T09:47:04-07:00","id":447845,"title":"","content":"Especially since if they go into <i>Basu-Im</i>, most of the Facets that buff them to scariness suddenly become automatic and free.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T10:10:26-07:00","id":447886,"title":"","content":"I know various people have been wondering about what the point of the higher Essence/turn rates that Primal Urge dots give you are actually for, given that lots of things only take 1 point of Essence.<br /> <br /> Well, one of the reasons that a higher Essence/turn rate is good is because you can flick lots of combat Facet switches to FULL KILL much faster than someone of lower Primal Urge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":""